     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Thanks for the discussion on this issue and the resolution. Yes we should be able to work on this within next 2 months and we will contact contact you and the team to review the implementation. I would like to push it for 3.6. -Jerry",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
