      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Discussed Jerry's work thus far:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/JerryPan/fcrepo/tree/fcrepo-954\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/JerryPan/fcrepo/tree/fcrepo-954</a></p>\n\n<p>...at today's committer meeting:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCREPO/2011-09-27+-+Committer+Meeting\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCREPO/2011-09-27+-+Committer+Meeting</a></p>\n\n<p>(see notes on above page) There was agreement that we should recommend new configurations/dependencies for modules come in through spring config files instead of the old way, fedora.fcfg. Also, we discussed that a utility to do the conversion on a per-module basis (FCFG to spring config file) would be good. So \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-1001\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-1001\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"FCFG to Spring conversion utility\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-1001\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n was created.</p>\n\n<p>Scoping this for 3.6 since it now seems likely that the work &amp; tests will be ready in time for the release.</p>\n",
